   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一名女士将上面有香草和绿植的托盘放在植物架上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10318442"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c4/42/c442abdeb36b5c584b20ad5b4a8312fb.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c4/42/c442abdeb36b5c584b20ad5b4a8312fb.jpg",
     "text": ""
